Yes, it indeed does seem like what is happening.

I can suggest trying different timing function. Something like this:
```lua
require('mini.animate').setup({
  scroll = {
    timing = function(_, n) return math.min(250 / n, 5) end,
  }
})
```

It basically says that if single default step (which makes any animation 250 milliseconds long) takes more than 5 milliseconds, use 5 milliseconds. To me it solves this issue. You might tweak number according to the right of how your OS treats holding key.
